## 🔍 What Happened
CHARACTERS:
1. Caius ap Llywarch - Descendant of Lancelot du Lac, Devotion: THE SWORD. Currently, he is a skilled fighter but has just failed a BLADE test in a training match against a seasoned opponent.
2. Morgan le Fay - Sovereign of Avalon, ageless and precise. She has been waiting since Arthur crossed the water and is neither an ally nor villain to the party.
